  step,dige:3b88ba6df9702ffe
  step=2,desc:stand two wired tanks that differ only in how their fish wire sums — and wake one clock pulse,dige:806e6c2a34b653d0
  step=3,desc:3 clock pulses wait on each tank,dige:8a5e08ec6a41ab93
    Assertion:clock-pulses-wait-on,sentence:clock pulses wait on the wire until the tank is woken — they turn nothing by themselves
  step=4,desc:wake both tanks,dige:f828535a177e8ac3
    Assertion:three-clock-pulses-woken,sentence:three clock pulses woken together make three turns — a wire summed by count runs once per pulse
  step=5,desc:18 more clock pulses — and wake both tanks,dige:691d86bf14e31b63
    Assertion:four-fish-changed-pulses,sentence:four fish-changed pulses piled up wake a heron summed to the latest once — it arrives and eats nothing yet
    Assertion:the-same-pulses-summed,sentence:the same pulses summed by count wake the heron once each — it arrives and eats six fish at once
